# SYNTHETIC. Written from RFC 3207 and RFC 5321. Not a recording:
# phase-0 capture against a real server has not happened yet.
# STARTTLS is required and the server did not offer it. The client must not
# fall through to AUTH in cleartext.

S: 220 smtp.example ESMTP ready
C: EHLO client.example
S: 250-smtp.example Hello
S: 250 AUTH LOGIN
FAIL Unsupported
